      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 5.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.96,
      "text": "Come in, have a seat by the desk."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 6.79,
      "end_seconds": 9.9,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "Hello, thanks for fitting me in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 10.66,
      "end_seconds": 13.21,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "Tell me what's brought you in."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.81,
      "end_seconds": 21.78,
      "duration_seconds": 6.97,
      "text": "Oh, it's trouble sleeping. I thought I'd wait, but it hasn't gone."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.62,
      "end_seconds": 25.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.11,
      "text": "How long has it been like this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 27.75,
      "end_seconds": 31.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "I've had it for six months"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 32.11,
      "end_seconds": 35.24,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Which medicines do you take at the moment?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 38.21,
      "end_seconds": 41.73,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "I'm on magnesium tablets, at night."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 43.24,
      "end_seconds": 47.86,
      "duration_seconds": 4.62,
      "text": "okay, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.4,
      "end_seconds": 53.62,
      "duration_seconds": 4.22,
      "text": "No, um, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 67.86,
      "end_seconds": 72.63,
      "duration_seconds": 4.77,
      "text": "Let's talk a little about your daily life and habits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.45,
      "end_seconds": 86.39,
      "duration_seconds": 11.94,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother. I drink a lot of tea and snack through the day. I do a yoga class on Thursdays."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 102.11,
      "end_seconds": 104.53,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.51,
      "end_seconds": 107.9,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "no, not at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 108.78,
      "end_seconds": 116.18,
      "duration_seconds": 7.4,
      "text": "any shortness of breath, swelling of the legs or weakness in the legs at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 117.6,
      "end_seconds": 124.86,
      "duration_seconds": 7.26,
      "text": "No, no shortness of breath, swelling of the legs or weakness in the legs."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.87,
      "end_seconds": 131.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.72,
      "text": "Right, have you had redness of the leg, by any chance?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 136.51,
      "end_seconds": 140.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.37,
      "text": "not at all, no redness of the leg"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 141.65,
      "end_seconds": 144.0,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "Any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 144.77,
      "end_seconds": 147.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.36,
      "text": "No, my breathing's been fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 149.21,
      "end_seconds": 153.1,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "Anything with your nerves, like weakness or numbness?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 156.47,
      "end_seconds": 158.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Ah, no, that's all normal."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 175.76,
      "end_seconds": 179.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.62,
      "text": "Alright, time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.75,
      "end_seconds": 195.28,
      "duration_seconds": 2.53,
      "text": "That's it, just a little longer..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 211.85,
      "end_seconds": 222.22,
      "duration_seconds": 10.37,
      "text": "okay: temperature is 36.6 degrees, pulse is 68 beats a minute, blood pressure 118 over 69, SpO2 97 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 223.33,
      "end_seconds": 226.37,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "is that alright, um, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 227.96,
      "end_seconds": 232.32,
      "duration_seconds": 4.36,
      "text": "Right, I'll explain what these mean in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.32,
      "end_seconds": 250.85,
      "duration_seconds": 7.53,
      "text": "Listening to the whole story, it fits best with night-time muscle cramps without a worrying cause."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 251.94,
      "end_seconds": 253.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Will it clear up?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.71,
      "end_seconds": 270.53,
      "duration_seconds": 14.82,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with night-time muscle cramps without a worrying cause do well once it's treated properly. I'll request a vitamin level, it'll help with tingling feet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 272.57,
      "end_seconds": 274.84,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "That's fine with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 276.72,
      "end_seconds": 304.14,
      "duration_seconds": 27.42,
      "text": "Let's get a blood sugar test, for tingling feet. Keep well hydrated through the day. Gentle calf stretches against a wall before bed often help. Try to get to bed and wake up at the same time each day, and keep your phone away from the bed. Let's review you after the results are back. Does all of that make sense?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.11,
      "end_seconds": 308.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "I think I understand everything. Thanks."
    }
  ]
}